[CRITICAL — Apple Review blocker] Reorder branches in /app/frontend/app/index.tsx around lines 261-268 so that `status === 401` is checked BEFORE the `typeof detail === 'string'` fallback. Suggested code:

  if (status === 401) {
    msg = t('auth.loginErrors.invalidCredentials');
  } else if (typeof detail === 'string') {
    msg = detail;
  } else {
    msg = t('auth.loginErrors.defaultMsg');
  }

Without this swap, the Apple reviewer with EN selected will STILL see the French body and reject Build 107 for the same Guideline 2.1 reason as Build 106.
